  "no_plan_because": "No plan fits this run, so none is named (card 033 section 6). The only pre-measurement plan, plan-mic-20260920-001, is written for the 100x oil objective with software-driven turret and focus steps, and its axis ranges were computed for that configuration; a new revision citing 100x ranges for this 20x, hand-moved run would be laundering. A new question for the 20x bare-particle pre-measurement will cite this run as its acquisition. run_log.schema.json requires plan_id as a string; that is raised to architecture, and until it is answered this log lives beside the frames, outside the repository.",
